### http-method-nocase
alert http any any -> any any (msg:"x"; http.method; content:"post"; nocase; sid:1;)
### http-two-uri-buffers
alert http any any -> any any (msg:"x"; http.uri; content:"/collect-demo"; http.uri; content:"41"; sid:1;)
### http-host
alert http any any -> any any (msg:"x"; http.host; content:"harbor"; sid:1;)
